        -:  157:
        -:  158:    /**
        -:  159:     * Return the modify hash of a single library if it is currently loaded.
        -:  160:     *
        -:  161:     * Unlike GetModifyHash(), which sums the hashes of every loaded library, this reports just the
        -:  162:     * named library so callers can react to changes in a specific dependency without being disturbed
        -:  163:     * by unrelated (for example asynchronously loading) libraries.
        -:  164:     *
        -:  165:     * @param aNickname is the library nickname in the symbol library table.
        -:  166:     * @return the library's modify hash, or std::nullopt if it is not loaded.
        -:  167:     */
        -:  168:    std::optional<int> GetLibraryModifyHash( const wxString& aNickname ) const;
